From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] comdlg32: item dialog stubs (IFileDialog2, IFileSaveDialog, ICommDlgBrowser3, IFileDialogCustomize)

comdlg32: item dialog stubs (IFileDialog2, IFileSaveDialog, ICommDlgBrowser3, IFileDialogCustomize)

IOleWindow::ContextSensitiveHelp, ClearClientData (E_FAIL until a client
GUID is set), SetFilter (an IShellItemFilter applied in IncludeObject),
AddPlace (FDAP validation, ordered list, items held), SetNavigationRoot,
the file type index (0 until chosen or shown), IFileSaveDialog
SetSaveAsItem / SetProperties / GetProperties / SetCollectedProperties /
ApplyProperties, the ICommDlgBrowser3 callbacks (Notify,
GetDefaultMenuText, GetViewFlags with FOS_FORCESHOWHIDDEN, OnColumnClicked,
GetCurrentFilter, OnPreViewCreated), IFileDialogCustomize
SetControlItemText / MakeProminent and the E_INVALIDARG results for unknown
controls.  Conformance todo_wine marks that now pass are removed; the
spurious PrintDlg Collate FIXMEs go (the output was already written).
---
